[[Mosshide Fen]] is a region of the eastern [[Wetlands]] which has fallen under control of the Mosshide [[gnolls]]. Several of their camps dot the landscape, and their vicious leader [[Gnawbone]] command his tribe to capture and eat any adventurers they spot stalking through the marshlands looking for tinder.

